Why Is Demand Increasing
Rising Prescription and Specialty-Drug Spending: Increasing prescription volumes and the growing economic importance of high-cost specialty medicines are expanding demand for sophisticated pharmacy-benefit administration.
Complex Benefit Management: Health plans, employers, and government programs increasingly require formulary management, claims processing, pharmacy-network administration, and utilization controls.
Digital Transformation: AI-driven analytics, real-time benefit tools, mobile platforms, and technology-enabled PBM models are improving data visibility and administrative efficiency.

Pharmacy Benefit Management Watch: Transparency and Technology
PBM models are evolving as employers and health plans seek greater visibility into fees, rebates, pharmacy reimbursement, and contracting structures. Technology-enabled platforms are also expanding into real-time analytics, digital benefit tools, electronic prior authorization, and integrated pharmacy-management services.

