Why This Market Matters
Pharmacy Benefit Management organizations play a central role in administering prescription-drug benefits for employers, health plans, government programs, and other payers. As specialty medicines, prescription spending, regulatory requirements, and digital healthcare services become more complex, PBMs are expanding their capabilities across claims administration, formulary management, pharmacy networks, specialty services, analytics, and member-facing technologies.

